{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LATER is a narrative-driven hidden object game about doing things later. Explore a lovingly hand-drawn 2D comic world where a mysterious, cat-like creature invites you to a game of hide and seek. What starts as a playful challenge quickly turns into an intense journey through inner conflicts and the darker sides of procrastination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/extras/Later_SteamBanner_Blinking_new.gif?t=1748719332\" />Unique Hidden Object Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Search for a lovable creature hiding in an increasingly cluttered apartment \u2013 and maybe uncover a few secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Short and Impactful </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to be completed in around 20\u201330 minutes, offering a unique experience in one sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmospheric 2D Comic Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovingly hand-drawn black-and-white visuals with a melancholic undertone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Surreal Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A short, narrative-driven game that will surprise you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully playable using just the left mouse button \u2013 perfect for a relaxed and accessible experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3229910?t=1748719332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3229910?t=1748719332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/3239f66bbb6cf1d6a7959dfd23f97884ecc25411/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748719332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229910/3239f66bbb6cf1d6a7959dfd23f97884ecc25411/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748719332","categories":[{"description":"Single-